          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "17b021d833e88c842a7ff30ae1e35013da70c4afa207bf0013403890f5d13758",
          "excerpt": "至是因璋之敗，率眾以害之，傳其首於西川。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v043",
          "paragraphId": "old-v043-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "0482ad5f9b9e0fa053ace49d5205cc19df259a4a76fa307a640a9218ff27e5b0",
          "excerpt": "六月壬子朔，幽州趙德鈞奏："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v043",
          "paragraphId": "old-v043-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "0482ad5f9b9e0fa053ace49d5205cc19df259a4a76fa307a640a9218ff27e5b0",
          "excerpt": "戊午，荊南奏：「東川董璋領兵至漢州，西川孟知祥出兵逆戰，璋大敗，得部下人二十餘，走入東川城，尋為前陵州刺史王暉所殺，孟知祥已入梓州。」"
        }
      ]
    },
